        f"💎 Sizda: {u['diamond']} Olmos   🪙 {u['coin']} Coin\n"
        f"📈 Joriy jonli kurs: <b>1 🪙 = {rate} 💎</b> {arrow}\n"
        "(kurs vaqti bilan biroz tebranib turadi — /kurs)\n\n"
